    <comment>Wind effect noted on Cathedral and Mt Stephen. Very lage cornices on Wapta Peak. No new avalanches  \nobserved from the past 24 hours. No avalanches down to road - alders still standingin runout under Wapta. \nsnow surface near 0 C - staying reasonably dry at this elevation  with overcast sky, suspect sun melt on south \naspects as soon as clouds disipate. 32 cm on interval board, last cleared 2013 01 18.\n</comment>
